d on the internal intranet and distributed to all relevant staff; attestation of receipt and understanding is collected and tracked.", "Compliance monitors effective implementation through scheduled control testing; findings are reported to senior management quarterly."], "residual_risk_if_failed": "High"}}, {"obligation_id": "REQ-008-OB-002", "obligation_text": "Review and enhance internal policies, procedures and controls as needed.", "execution_category": "One_Time_Implementation", "control": null}, {"obligation_id": "REQ-008-OB-003", "obligation_text": "Apply its internal policies, procedures and controls to all of its branches and majority-owned subsidiaries.", "execution_category": "Ongoing_Control", "control": {"control_title": "Group-Wide AML Policy Application to Branches and Subsidiaries", "control_objective": "Ensure the institution''s AML/CFT policies, procedures, and controls are implemented consistently across all branches and majority-owned subsidiaries.", "control_description": "The group AML/CFT policy explicitly states its applicability to all branches and majority-owned subsidiaries. Compliance maintains an entity register covering all in-scope entities and coordinates an annual implementation attestation process. Local compliance officers at each branch/subsidiary confirm policy implementation in writing; exceptions are reported to group Compliance for escalation and remediation tracking.", "control_owner": "Compliance / Group Functions", "control_type": "Detective", "execution_type": "Manual", "frequency": "Annual attestation + Event-Driven (new branch/subsidiary, policy update)", "control_level": "Policy", "evidence_generated": "Group entity register; signed annual implementation attestation from each branch/subsidiary compliance officer; exception and remediation log", "key_steps": ["Group Compliance maintains an up-to-date register of all branches and majority-owned subsidiaries subject to the group AML/CFT policy.", "Following each policy update or on an annual basis, group Compliance distributes the current policy package to all entities with an implementation confirmation form.", "Local compliance officers review the policy, confirm implementation (or document exceptions), and return signed attestations by the required deadline.", "Group Compliance consolidates attestations and identifies entities with exceptions or non-responses; these are escalated to the group MLRO.", "Remediation plans are established for any exceptions and tracked to closure; the consolidated attestation summary is presented to the AML Committee."], "residual_risk_if_failed": "High"}}]}',
