 code of conduct with tipping-off clause; STR system access log", "key_steps": ["AML policy and employee code of conduct are reviewed annually to confirm the tipping-off prohibition is explicitly and clearly stated.", "Annual AML training program includes a mandatory tipping-off module; completion is tracked in the HR learning management system.", "STR case management system restricts access to STR records to authorized FIU and Compliance personnel only; access is logged and reviewed quarterly.", "Any suspected tipping-off incident is reported to the MLRO and escalated for investigation; outcomes are documented.", "Compliance reports annual training completion rates to senior management; staff with overdue training are escalated through line management."], "residual_risk_if_failed": "High"}]}'
